Looking at this problem, I need to determine whether the bisection property (every hyperplane through the origin splits $U$ into two equal-measure parts) forces $U = -U$.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem statement contains no leaked answers, solutions, or solution sketches. Proceeding to solve.

